# mmm's searches, along the top, 1 to 9 and 0 in this order: Name = notmuch query.
# Mail tagged deleted or spam is left out of every search unless the query names the tag
# (notmuch's search.exclude_tags), so Bin needs no "not tag:deleted" elsewhere.
# Waiting: mail with a PDF that waits for t or x, before anything goes to Nextcloud.
# Screener: new mail from senders you don't know, and mail that looks like spam (deck-mail filter);
# it's still in Gmail's inbox. A lets the sender in, B blocks them, ! reports spam.
Inbox = tag:inbox and not tag:screener and not tag:suspect
Screener = tag:inbox and (tag:screener or tag:suspect)
Unread = tag:unread
Starred = tag:flagged
Waiting = tag:pdf-waiting
Sent = tag:sent
Drafts = tag:draft
Everything = *
Bin = tag:deleted
Spam = tag:spam
